msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released both https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-33-released/"
"[Quarkus 3.33 LTS] and Quarkus 3.34."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"While Quarkus 3.33 is a Long Term Support (LTS) release, branched from "
"Quarkus 3.32 and maintained for 12 months,\n"
"Quarkus 3.34 comes with a lot of enhancements across the board:\n"
"Dev UI, Panache Next, and a lot of other areas got improved."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This release also includes internal changes and refactorings that will bear "
"fruits in future versions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To update to Quarkus 3.34, we recommend updating to the latest version of "
"the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of "
"Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.34."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For more information about the adjustments you need to make to your "
"applications, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/"
"Migration-Guide-3.34[Quarkus 3.34 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.34.0.CR1[3.34.0.CR1], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.34.0[3.34.0], and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.34.1[3.34.1] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

